## Layout

Use a consistent layout across the segment:

- White background.
- Actual app icon and MyNetWorth name at the top.
- Phone mockup slightly right of center.
- Animated text on the left.
- Dark navy or charcoal text.
- Green checkmarks for the three features.
- Generous whitespace.
- Clear typography suitable for mobile YouTube viewing.

Avoid tiny text, unnecessary decorative elements, shadows, gradients, flashy transitions or exaggerated animations.

Use the existing project's fonts and design conventions where appropriate.

The phone should display genuine screen recordings, not simulated financial data or AI-generated interface elements.

## Animation

Use Remotion's deterministic frame-based animation utilities.

Prefer subtle opacity changes, short translations and simple crossfades.

No bouncing, spinning, zooming text or elaborate motion graphics.

Screen recordings should play at a natural speed.

If a recording is longer than its allocated slot, select a useful portion rather than speeding it up excessively.

The feature transitions can be fast because all three labels remain visible during the final privacy message.

